{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "workflow-colonial-5", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-14T03:58:51Z", "id": "chunk_curriculum-colonial_colonial-5_seosa-tap", "lang": "ko", "locator": "본문 '내용'", "pageSha256": "5b5b696032ffa4618e8fb99f00ea2c16000f012aeb2021b38c3becce9d78bd2c", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0076120", "sourceId": "src-hs-enc-seosa", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0076120", "text": "조선신궁 경내에 황국신민서사의 탑[皇國臣民誓詞之柱]을 세웠다"}
